<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh inflation quickens to 2.9 pct in October.</title>
<headline>Kazakh inflation quickens to 2.9 pct in October.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's monthly inflation rate quickened to 2.9 percent in October from 1.2 percent in September, the National Bank of Kazakhstan said on Friday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH CONSUMER PRICES     OCT 96    SEP 96    OCT 95</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change   +2.9	+1.2	+4.1</p>
<p>The year-on-year percentage change was not available. The National Bank estimates annual inflation for 1996 at 27.5 percent.</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
